WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,290
Anywhere

2
00:00:01,290 --> 00:00:02,610
I am the sword of the Tanglang clan

3
00:00:02,610 --> 00:00:05,210
Cut wherever you are told.

4
00:00:05,210 --> 00:00:07,010
You can't go to the battlefield on an empty stomach, right?

5
00:00:07,670 --> 00:00:09,150
Eight-grade yellow leg meat

6
00:00:09,150 --> 00:00:10,150
open to eat

7
00:00:10,150 --> 00:00:11,350
I don't like meat

8
00:00:11,350 --> 00:00:13,390
Generally, you can rest assured when eating energy boxes

9
00:00:13,390 --> 00:00:14,390
I eat very little

10
00:00:15,430 --> 00:00:16,470
An eighth grade

11
00:00:16,470 --> 00:00:19,190
How about adding five more seventh-grade coins?

12
00:00:19,590 --> 00:00:20,790
too much

13
00:00:20,790 --> 00:00:21,950
Can't finish it at all

14
00:00:22,230 --> 00:00:23,790
Why don't you let me in your underwear?

15
00:00:23,790 --> 00:00:25,150
Just eat whatever you want

16
00:00:25,150 --> 00:00:27,910
You're such a wolf, it's okay to be weird

17
00:00:27,910 --> 00:00:29,470
It will be fine if you eat it for three to five days

18
00:00:29,590 --> 00:00:31,470
You can also bring an eighth-grade box with you when you come out.

19
00:00:31,470 --> 00:00:32,390
No need to bring it

20
00:00:32,390 --> 00:00:33,630
Just make me full

21
00:00:34,780 --> 00:00:36,380
Don’t move the ninth-grade one

22
00:00:36,380 --> 00:00:37,540
You are only in the eighth grade

23
00:00:37,540 --> 00:00:39,420
Absorbing high-quality energy can be dangerous

24
00:00:39,860 --> 00:00:41,180
Thank you Queen for your concern

25
00:00:41,680 --> 00:00:42,800
You can rest assured

26
00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:44,720
I will never put myself in danger

27
00:00:45,700 --> 00:00:47,060
Grandpa will take you there

28
00:00:47,060 --> 00:00:48,980
My injury has not healed and it is difficult to move around.

29
00:00:51,340 --> 00:00:52,580
Don't be formal

30
00:00:52,580 --> 00:00:54,300
It's okay to be a little greedy

31
00:00:55,130 --> 00:00:56,410
Then I will

32
00:00:56,410 --> 00:00:57,970
A little greedy

33
00:00:58,370 --> 00:00:59,730
We are going to work hard

34
00:00:59,730 --> 00:01:00,730
Eat freely

35
00:01:00,730 --> 00:01:01,930
The Queen will not be stingy

36
00:01:02,810 --> 00:01:04,850
Listen to Great Ancestor, Your Great Ancestor

37
00:01:05,350 --> 00:01:06,510
This is the hero

38
00:01:06,510 --> 00:01:08,070
The Queen rewarded her with wearing underwear once

39
00:01:08,890 --> 00:01:10,050
Holy land chess

40
00:01:10,050 --> 00:01:11,130
Three or five days is too long

41
00:01:11,130 --> 00:01:13,610
Just shorten it to one day, you don’t need me to be quick

42
00:01:13,610 --> 00:01:15,770
It’s important to come out before sunset
